5.Sanitation in the manufacturing premises
(i) The manufacture area shall not be utilised for any other purpose;
(ii) The manufacturing premises shall be maintained clean and in an orderly manner, free from accumulated waste, dust,
debris, etc.;
(iii) Eating, chewing, smoking or any unhygienic practices shall not be permitted in the manufacturing area;
(iv) The manufacturing area shall not be used for general thoroughfare for personnel or for storage of materials, except
for material being processed;
